3. Secret
---------------------------------------------------------------------
    tgb-shopverse-gitops(Administration: read and write)
    ----------------------------------------------------
kubectl create secret generic shopverse-github-token \
  -n arc-runners \
  --from-literal=github_token='YOUR_PAT'

Note: You can achieve this using ESO also.
